  "footer": {
    "title": "A foreshadowing of baptism",
    "content": "Paul writes that Israel was \"baptized into Moses in the cloud and in the sea\" ({{1Cor 10:2}}). The Red Sea miracle is a picture of baptism: We pass through the water, the old pharaoh (sin) drowns, and we come out on the other side as a free people."
